    "title": "CITY OF MYRTLE CREEK LISTS PUBLIC MEETINGS FOR APRIL - NewsBreak",
    "text": "17 hours ago The City of Myrtle Creek has listed its public meetings for the month of April. *The Myrtle Creek Urban Renewal Agency Budget Committee will hold a regular meeting at 4:30 p.m. on Tuesday, April 7th. Immediately following will be a regular City Council meeting at 5:30 p.m. The Urban Renewal Agency will gather after the council meeting. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
